# ============================================================================
# Vue 3 Car Rental frontend — environment variables
# Copy this file to `.env` and adjust. `.env` is gitignored.
# ============================================================================

# Base URL prefix for the backend API.
# - Local dev: Vite proxies /api -> http://localhost:8080 (see vite.config.js),
#   so the value below works without CORS.
# - Production: either keep "/api" and let nginx proxy it, OR point at the
#   backend domain directly, e.g.:
#     VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend-domain.com/api
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api

# NOTE: VITE_CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME, VITE_CLOUDINARY_UPLOAD_PRESET and
# VITE_CLOUDINARY_VEHICLE_PRESET are NO LONGER NEEDED. Since Phase 3B-1 image
# uploads go through the backend (/api/uploads), the browser never talks to
# Cloudinary directly. Backend credentials (CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME,
# CLOUDINARY_API_KEY, CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET) are still required on the server.